      <div>
        <p class="mb-4 text-[15.5px] leading-[1.7] text-[#4A5372]">SparkX is designed for individuals with a technology-driven problem worth solving, but without a structured way, yet, to validate it. It gives that idea a defined 45-day process rather than leaving it to chance.</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-[15.5px] leading-[1.7] text-[#4A5372]">The program closes with a Demo Day where participants present the concept they've validated over the 45 days.</p>
